-- Turkey deep-dive content (English). Turkey is the most mature
-- mandate added this session outside South Korea -- e-Fatura has been
-- mandatory since 1 April 2014 -- and, like Vietnam, genuinely has two
-- coexisting systems rather than one: e-Fatura (centralized clearance
-- through the Revenue Administration, GİB, for registered recipients)
-- and e-Arşiv (post-issuance reporting for everyone else, including
-- consumers). Modeled as two separate lifecycle pill cards per the
-- same Malaysia/Vietnam precedent of multiple genuinely-distinct
-- pill-list cards in one section. The penalty structure is also its
-- own shape: a percentage-of-invoice-value fine with an inflation-
-- indexed minimum (Vergi Usul Kanunu, Mükerrer Madde 355), applied
-- unusually to BOTH the issuer and the recipient who accepts a
-- non-compliant invoice.










